    "insert": "The proposal is rich on citations, which gives it more credibility and shows the engagement with the proposed research topic. However, the citations are probably added manually, so that the citation numbers are not in correct order. For example, the very first citation in the hook starts with 7. Ensure that the citation numbers are automatically adjusted. If using a citation manager, update the references and check for any misplaced or missing citations.\n(SOTA)"
