  {
    "insert": "The SOTA section briefly addresses the role of AI-powered tools in healthcare. While this provides a helpful overview, the SOTA section would benefit from a more detailed review of recent studies and advancements in generative AI technologies applied to direct patient interaction. It is recommended to consider including specific examples of SOTA AI models and their applications in healthcare, with a focus on their performance, limitations, and relevance to healthcare.\n(3. Sub RQ)"
